                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "They will ban you without reason, then refuse to elaborate or fix the issue. \n\nI tried to try this game back in 2021. I was trying with another friend. We weren't able to find a matching schedule to play, and ended up being forgotten. Few days ago i decide to try out the game by myself, only to find out I was banned. I barely played the game for an hour back when i 1st tried to try the game (I assume they thought I was bot account or something). I sent a support ticket only to be told my account was banned for security reasons, and because i was banned more than 6 months ago, they can't look into it, and there is nothing they can do. The devs and publisher are full of ****. I don't recommend anyone into trying this game.",
